Subject: [PATCH 16/39] bitproxy: VPN/Direct switches for apps on the dashboard

New dashboard card listing every configured app and clone with a
VPN/Direct switch and a shortcut to the full app picker. A flip is
saved and re-applied (batched), so the app's route, its selector default
and its DNS rule all follow, unlike a live switch in the Groups tab.
The upstream dashboard hook now calls bitProxyDashboardItems(), which
adds both the Always-on badge and this card.
